  text: 
  ru: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0432\u044B \u0441\u0442\u043E\u043B\u043A\u043D\u0443\u043B\u0438\u0441\u044C
    \u0441 \u043A\u0430\u043A\u0438\u043C\u0438-\u043B\u0438\u0431\u043E \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043B\u0435\u043C\u0430\u043C\u0438
    \u0438\u043B\u0438 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E \u0445\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0442
    \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u044D\u043C\u043E\u0446\u0438\u044F\u043C\u0438,
    \u043D\u0430\u043F\u0438\u0448\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u043C!"
  en: If you encounter any problems or just want to share your emotions, write to
    us!
  tr: "Herhangi bir sorunla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015F\u0131rsan\u0131z veya sadece
    duygular\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 payla\u015Fmak istiyorsan\u0131z bize yaz\u0131n!"
  az: 
  be: 
  he: 
  hy: 
  ka: 
  et: 
  fr: "Si vous rencontrez des probl\xE8mes ou souhaitez simplement partager vos \xE9motions,
    \xE9crivez-nous !"
  kk: 
  ky: 
  lt: 
  lv: 
  ro: 
  tg: 
  tk: 
  uk: 
  uz: 
  es: "Si tienes alg\xFAn problema o simplemente quieres compartir tus emociones,
    \xA1escr\xEDbenos!"
  pt: "Se voc\xEA encontrar algum problema ou apenas quiser compartilhar suas emo\xE7\xF5es,
    escreva para n\xF3s!"
  ar: 
  id: 
  ja: 
  it: 
  de: "Wenn Sie auf Probleme sto\xDFen oder einfach nur Ihre Gef\xFChle mitteilen
    m\xF6chten, schreiben Sie uns!"
  hi: 
  changeOnlyFont: 0
  fontNumber: 0
  uniqueFont: {fileID: 0}
  additionalText: {fileID: 0}
  textHeight: 20
  processTranslateLabel: 7/19 completed
  componentTextField: 1
  countLang: 7
